1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,565
Polarization is all around you.

2
00:00:02,565 --> 00:00:12,500
Polarizing sunglasses: glare from water and roads is mostly horizontally polarized, so the lenses pass only vertical vibrations.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,744
Camera filters that darken the sky and remove reflections.

4
00:00:16,744 --> 00:00:24,856
The LCD screen of every calculator and phone, which works by twisting polarized light between crossed sheets.

5
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:29,856
3 D films, where each eye gets light polarized at right angles.

6
00:00:29,856 --> 00:00:37,786
Engineers' stress analysis, where a plastic model of a bridge glows with coloured fringes between crossed Polaroids.

7
00:00:37,786 --> 00:00:40,546
And simple, smooth light dimmers.

